---

switch-to-unifi is an independent project with no affiliation to Ubiquiti
Inc. "UniFi" and "Ubiquiti" are trademarks of Ubiquiti Inc.

This project builds on github.com/jamesbraid/unifi-emu (MIT, Copyright (c)
James Braid): its `inform` package provides the UniFi inform wire format,
crypto and packet handling as a dependency, its model catalogue and
capability bitmaps are used at build time, and internal/device is a fork of
its inform session and tables (see the package documentation there). Its
docs/PROTOCOL.md was the starting point for docs/protocol-connection-points.md.
